review_text:
Slightly dated hotel but very value for money;
Hotel staff were very helpful and professional;
Room has proper desk to work with (and LAN port);
Room wifi was okay;
Has a decent public bath;
Location is a 10minute walk down the road from the busy tenmonkan street where all the food and activities happen (or 1 tram stop away);
It’s also 3 tram stops away from main train station kagoshimachuo.
Located at the intersection of 2 tram lines, which can be convenient when getting back to the hotel (just need to get the tram direction correct)

Pontos positibos:
Boa localização perto dos transporte e lojas de conveniência;
Limpeza e insonorização. 
Pontos Negativos:
Pequeno almoço pouco variado e poucas qualidade;
Conforto dos colchões;
A antipatia da senhora da sala de refeições
